    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... people always say there's hope. but it feels like such a lie. it's like everyone is just saying what they're supposed to say. how can there be hope when the only person i ever truly wanted to be with isn't here? it feels like i'm just a ghost wandering around a house that doesn't belong to me anymore. i just want the silence to stop. i just want to be where he is.",
